WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.130
What is this place?!

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.380
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:14.240
Welcome to the combat 
paradise of Ironman Fist!

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>This bizarre, arbitrary turn of events...</i>

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.000
<i>It has to be an amasogi.</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:44.060
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:44.060
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:55.280
<b>Versus</b>

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.070
You suck at this, Akito!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:02.260
You didn't catch anything yourself.

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.530
Haven't you had enough fun?

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:08.390
Nope! You said you'd take 
me out for the whole day!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.170
And you've gotta actually entertain me!

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.300
Okay, fine...

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.650
Ironman Fist<i>!</i>

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.770
I wanna play you in that!

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.760
Wh-What the?!

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:26.480
Hey, it's that guy! Kagami Kazuya!

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.690
Could you get down?

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:30.920
<i>The malison exorcist and his tsugumomo!</i>

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:30.920
Is this a friend of yours?

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.740
<i>I've been able to keep an eye on 
them by pretending to be a student,</i>

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.940
<i>but I didn't expect to run into him here...</i>

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.520
Kiriha's here, too!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.220
Have we met?

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.930
<i>Try and bluff through this, Mimane!</i>

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.750
Let's see...

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.940
I'm Miyou Mimane! I go to 
the same school as you guys!

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.160
You look more like an 
elementary school student.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.090
<i>W-Well, that should work, 
but we need to get out of here...</i>

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:56.940
Akito!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.090
Let's play with Kazuya!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.780
<i>That idiot!</i>

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:04.240
Hey, Ashimine-kun! 
It's me, Kagami, from class.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.450
Didn't expect to see you here.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.800
Hup!

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.720
Would you like to play, too?

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.060
Uh, no, that's...

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.860
Come on, Akito!

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:12.960
Mimane, no...

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:16.710
<i>Azami?</i>

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:20.720
<i>Is she upset that we've made contact 
with the malison exorcist?!</i>

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.370
It's reacting...

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.760
<i>Azami must've radiated enough 
malison to create an amasogi.</i>

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.530
Kiriha-san, do you think...

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.660
Yes, it's definitely an amasogi.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.810
We'd better deal with it fast, then.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.730
Easier said than done. We don't know 
anything about the amasogi's true form,

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.680
its master, or the wish...

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.420
Welcome to the world of <i>Ironman Fist</i>!

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.420
<b>The Amasogi's True Form</b>

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:02.800
And I'm the tournament's organizer, 
Hirohashi Hiroki, age 33!

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:02.420
<b>Its Master</b>

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.200
And I just wanna play video games!

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.930
<b>His Wish</b>

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.680
<i>That's simple enough.</i>

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.450
Time for a red-hot clash between 
rugged competitors of wrought metal!

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:14.060
Let the <i>Ironman Fist</i> tournament begin!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:18.280
In essence, we're inside a fighting game.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.370
So we'll need to win a 4-on-4 team battle

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:25.700
and have that Hirohashi fellow 
destroy the game's cabinet.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.040
Kiriha-san!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.200
You can enjoy the show from there. 
I'll handle all three foes.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:34.920
<i>For now, we should cooperate with 
them so we can escape this place.</i>

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.870
Our opening match is 
Kiriha of Team Exorcist...

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:44.190
<b>Kiriha</b>

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:43.780
versus Daruman of Team Kamioka Empire!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:44.190
<b>Daruman</b>

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.610
<i>Fight!</i>

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.800
I see no point in wasting 
time on this nonsense!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.350
Spiral Weave!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.480
Why can't I weave a spiral?!

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.480
I get it! Spiral Weave is a finishing move,

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.610
so you can't use it without 
building up the meter first!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.240
What?! The fighting game 
logic goes that far?!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:08.580
Ow!

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.260
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:14.250
I can't move! What is this, 
one of those infinite combos?!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.660
No, Kiriha-san!

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.170
It's a low attack, so you can't 
block it if you're standing!

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.420
So annoying...

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:23.920
<b>Middle Kick</b>

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.920
<i>K.O.!</i>

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.870
Daruman wins!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:32.940
<i>Perfect!</i>

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.300
That was weak, Kiriha!

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:36.690
Are you okay, Kiriha-san?

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:39.560
And now comes the penalty for the loser!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.690
Penalty?

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.940
It's a bikini and cat ears!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.340
Her costume was changed?

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:50.950
I get it! If you lose, the other 
player gets to edit your costume!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.150
This is so aggravating...

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:55.700
Wait, you're embarrassed, Kiriha-san?

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.130
That's a shock.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:00.460
Do you think I'm some sort of exhibitionist?

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.960
It's not the same as 
being on display for you.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.450
Kiriha-san...

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.340
Now, it's time for the next 
fighter to come on down!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:11.090
I'll go.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.100
Ashimine-kun?

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.520
Wait, what about me?!

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.850
It'll be okay. I'm somewhat 
familiar with this game.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:21.150
Daruman versus Team Exorcist's 
second man, Ashimine Akito!

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:20.750
<b>Daruman</b>

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.750
<b>Ashimine Akito</b>

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.360
<i>Fight!</i>

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.690
He's blocking everything!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.870
Yeah, he's way better than Kiriha!

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.240
Hush up.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.760
<i>I can't risk exposing my identity.</i>

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.250
<i>But if this is all he can do...</i>

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.000
<i>I can win barehanded!</i>

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:42.810
<i>K.O.!</i>

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.860
The winner is Ashimine Akito!

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.700
Now, what penalty costume awaits our loser—

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.260
None.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:53.200
Next up for Kamioka Empire is Kenshiro!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.260
<b>Kenshiro</b>

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.260
<b>Ashimine Akito</b>

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.230
Swords?!

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.440
That's cheating!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:01.280
Not at all! Weapons are 
legal in this tournament!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.120
<i>Fight!</i>

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.530
He's standing his ground?! That's crazy!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:10.030
<i>This is still a video game. It's not hard 
to predict the paths of these swords.</i>

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.030
<i>At the moment of impact, 
I change my hands into scissors...</i>

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.490
<i>and defend.</i>

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.040
<i>This way, they won't notice.</i>

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.280
<i>Time to put this meter to use!</i>

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:25.900
Unarmed Counter!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.670
<b>Unarmed Counter</b>

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.370
He won!

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.310
Nice, Akito!

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.340
No, not quite!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.430
<i>Draw!</i>

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.530
We've got a double K.O.!

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.770
And that means both teams get a penalty!

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.190
An eccentric choice!

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.290
<i>Amazing!</i>

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.190
And highly rated to boot!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.200
But I'm the one who lost.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.430
The costume is chosen at 
the winner's discretion.

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:55.690
Go ahead and pick something.

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.200
I already said don't want to!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.660
On to our next match! Both teams are 
fielding their penultimate fighters,

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:06.210
<b>Qigong Master
Namikawa</b>

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.890
with Qigong Master Namikawa 
representing Kamioka Empire!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.210
His opponent...

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.210
<b>Little Fighting Girl
Miyou Mimane</b>

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.980
Right here! It's finally my turn!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.180
Listen. Don't use your powers.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:10.660
They'll figure out your identity.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.470
Got it! You can count on me!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.610
<b>Qigong Master
Namikawa</b>

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.610
<b>Little Fighting Girl
Miyou Mimane</b>

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.050
Miyou Mimane!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:15.970
<i>Fight!</i>

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.720
Qi Blast!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.250
Blood Mirror!

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:26.650
Attack Symmetry!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.980
<b>Blood Mirror: Attack Symmetry</b>

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.490
What was that move?!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.490
Winner: Mimane!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.090
What's with the mirror?

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.290
It's nothing a normal human could use.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.370
<i>Mimane!</i>

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:46.010
I didn't think my turn would actually come...

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:47.580
Fascinating!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:54.130
It's him! The captain of Kamioka 
Empire, Almighty Hiroki!

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:57.450
<b>Almighty Hiroki</b>

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.450
Versus the Little Fighting 
Girl, Miyou Mimane!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:57.450
<b>Little Fighting Girl
Miyou Mimane</b>

00:08:58.210 --> 00:08:59.060
<i>Fight!</i>

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.260
Okay!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.270
Look at that speed!

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.290
What can Hiroki do?!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.280
He can hit her from that distance?!

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:20.280
Squirm all you want! 
I can still nail you with this!

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.280
<b>Extendable Limbs</b>

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.560
<i>K.O.!</i>

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:24.140
The winner is Almighty Hiroki!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.930
What penalty costume is coming up next?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.540
Naked with an apron!

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:32.620
If weapons are allowed...

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.580
Kiriha-san!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.300
Of course!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.450
Get equipped with: Tsukumogami!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:42.450
<b>Almighty Hiroki</b>

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:42.450
<b>Kagami Kazuya</b>

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.310
It's the head of Team 
Exorcist, Kagami Kazuya!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:42.630
This match will decide everything!

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:43.220
<i>Fight!</i>

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.280
Time to show you exactly 
why I'm called "Almighty"!

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:49.120
Mode Change: Grappler!

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.120
<b>Mode Change: Grappler!!!</b>

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.400
There it is! His specialty, mode changing!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.910
Avoid getting grabbed. Keep your distance!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:55.570
Right!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.570
You're not getting away!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.970
Vacuum!

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:02.330
And Hiroki tries to pull his opponent in! 
He's dead-set on grappling!

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.830
Woven Legs!

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:09.210
He's fast!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.460
I can see why you went last. In that case...

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.340
Mode Change:

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.730
Flame!

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:19.970
Obi Jab!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.720
Fireball!

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:25.900
Here he comes!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.100
Folks, this combo is as heavy as it is hot!

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.010
I guess this is it...

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.860
Fan Weave!

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.370
M-My flames!

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:43.290
Power Obi:

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:45.600
Hundred Flowers!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.930
<b>Power Obi: Hundred Flowers</b>

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.260
<i>K.O.!</i>

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.880
Winner: Kazuya!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.460
All right!

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.840
<i>He's strong. Even stronger than I expected.</i>

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:10.890
We're back, then.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.940
Looks like the amasogi's master destroyed it.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.920
That takes care of everything.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.610
I'm cold after wearing next to nothing. 
Need to use the lavatory.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.900
Thank you, Kazuya!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.730
Fighting you made me realize something.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.050
I was really hungry for a 
real pulse-pounding fight!

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:28.540
S-Sure...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.270
All right, I'm gonna take tomorrow 
off work and travel!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.370
<i>Uh, shouldn't a 33-year-old get back to work?</i>

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:36.960
<i>Azami!</i>

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:39.550
<i>She really is mad!</i>

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:44.680
<i>Mimane, Azami's in a bad mood! We need 
to get away from Kazuya and Kiriha, fast!</i>

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:46.300
<i>I get you.</i>

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.930
Kazuya!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.410
Smooch!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.620
Why?!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.610
That was "Mimane, go and kiss Kazuya," right?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.580
No!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:09.050
Are you okay?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:13.580
Here, you can wipe your face with this.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.380
<i>Azami calmed down in a flash...</i>

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.590
Kazuya!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.370
What was that noise?

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:24.370
Kiriha-san.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.400
The ceiling suddenly collapsed in.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.600
And this girl was...

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:28.860
Huh?

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.240
No matter, then.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.100
More importantly, Mimane...

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.450
You're a mirror tsugumomo, aren't you?

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.360
Yup!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.840
<i>Idiot!</i>

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.360
<b><b>Idiot</b></b>

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:45.400
Quite the handy power you 
have there. Let's be friends!

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:46.340
Sure!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.790
Does that mean you're her 
partner, Ashimine-kun?

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.370
Th-That's right.

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:54.060
<i>This has only gotten more complicated...</i>

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:59.650
<b>The Romantic Quiz Board Game</b>

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.840
Mimane's identity has been exposed.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.200
You need to be more cautious, Akito.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.270
I'm sorry.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:05.130
Seriously, get it together!

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.250
And whose fault was it?!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:10.350
Regardless, we can't risk them 
finding out anything else.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.400
<i>Better to avoid them as much as possible.</i>

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.600
<i>Yet here we are!</i>

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:22.140
You got caught up in this one, too? 
Your luck seems terrible.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:23.370
<i>Tell me about it!</i>

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.580
<i>A different amasogi caught me...</i>

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.860
Who's the girl?

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.960
O-Oh, this is my sister.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.460
I'm Ashimine Arumi.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:41.690
Romantic Quiz Board Game

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:39.830
Welcome, everyone!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:41.400
Wakisaka Wakana

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:44.630
You've been invited to this game 
as a pair of nice-looking couples!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.260
What game?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:50.010
I call it the {also what the sign says}Romantic Quiz Board Game!

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.010
<b>Romantic Quiz Board Game</b>

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:52.700
You make progress based 
on your rolls of the dice,

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.340
receiving questions depending on the space.

